# 📝 Task Manager

A simple, responsive Task Manager built with **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. Tasks are saved in the browser using **Local Storage**, so they stay even after you refresh or close the page.

Built for **Round 1 | Technical Operations**, Satsang (ABES Engineering College).

## 🔗 Links

- **Live Demo:** https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/YOUR-REPO-NAME/
- **Source Code:** https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO-NAME

## ✨ Features

- Add new tasks
- Mark tasks as complete or pending
- Delete tasks
- Edit existing tasks
- Filter tasks by **All / Pending / Completed**
- Tasks saved with **Local Storage**
- Live counter of tasks left
- Clear all completed tasks in one click
- Dark mode (your choice is remembered)
- Fully responsive for mobile and desktop

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3 (Flexbox, CSS variables, media queries)
- Vanilla JavaScript (DOM manipulation, Local Storage)

## 🚀 How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO-NAME.git
   ```
2. Open the folder:
   ```bash
   cd YOUR-REPO-NAME
   ```
3. Open `index.html` in any browser. No installation needed.

